ial diet is required before urine collection for tests to avoid false positives in the determination of metabolites like 5-HIA and VAMA.", "NEUROBLASTOMAS:Neuroblastomas are tumors that can arise from neuroblasts and are associated with catecholamine secretion, similar to pheochromocytomas.", "ÁCIDOS HOMOVANÍLICO Y VANILMANDÉLICO:Homovanillic acid and vanilmandelic acid are metabolites of catecholamines used in the diagnosis of neuroendocrine tumors.", "ALIMENTOS RICOS EN YODO:Los alimentos ricos en yodo son aquellos que pueden afectar la eficacia de los tratamientos relacionados con el tiroides.", "ALIMENTOS CON MÍNIMO RESIDUO:Los alimentos con mínimo residuo son aquellos que se deben consumir para facilitar estudios diagnósticos del tubo digestivo.", "PET/TC:PET/TC is a non-invasive imaging diagnostic technique that uses a radiopharmaceutical to detect cancerous cells and evaluate glucose metabolism in various tissues.", "18FLUORODESOXYGLUCOSE:18fluorodesoxiglucosa (FDG) is a radiopharmaceutical used in PET scans, primarily taken up by cells with high glucose consumption, including cancer cells.", "NUTRITIONAL SOLUTIONS:Nutritional solutions are specialized supplements designed to ensure nutritional balance, particularly during dietary restrictions that may occur before medical tests. These solutions encompass a variety of formulations aimed at providing essential nutrients to patients, especially those who are unable to consume food orally. They play a crucial role in maintaining health and supporting recovery in individuals with specific dietary needs.", "CANCER CELLS:Cancer cells are cells that grow uncontrollably and are primarily targeted in PET scans for diagnosis and monitoring.", "CARNE FIBROSA:Carne fibrosa refers to fibrous meats that are typically avoided in diets leading up to medical tests to ensure clarity in imaging.", "FRUTAS Y VERDURAS FRESCAS:Frutas y verduras frescas are fresh fruits and vegetables that are generally restricted in diets before medical tests to avoid interference with results."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}